WEBVTT

00:00:19.458 --> 00:00:26.458
Open*Sub_ID_FreePalestina
Sub*dl_ID_rawe

00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:09.000
Ryu!

00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:10.166
Di sini rupanya.

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:11.666
Semua aman?

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.041
Ya, aku baik.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.708
Kau dengar apa?

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.041
Kembalikan padaku.

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:20.458
- Ada masalah apa?
- Mari dengarkan.

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:26.041
Kau serius?

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:29.208
Kau lawan Sagat
di kejuaraan dunia,

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:30.541
lalu dengar ini?

00:01:30.541 --> 00:01:32.375
Ken,
aku suka lagu ini.

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:34.291
Bikin santai.

00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:35.583
Tepat sekali.

00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:37.166
Hentikan, Ken.

00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:39.583
Itu dia.

00:01:40.041 --> 00:01:41.375
Kau gegabah.

00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:45.541
Hidup itu bertarung.

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:47.958
Bertarung itu hidup.

00:02:02.916 --> 00:02:05.041
THAILAND 1987

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.000
Ayo, Ryu, kau pasti bisa!

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:09.583
Benar kan, Guru Gouken?

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.625
TURNAMEN WORLD WARRIOR

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:02.916
Dark Hadō.

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:05.041
Ryu, jangan takluk padanya.

00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:22.625
Apa?

00:03:33.541 --> 00:03:35.041
Akuma,

00:03:41.375 --> 00:03:42.833
Ryu menang!

00:03:47.208 --> 00:03:49.250
Apa itu tadi, Guru?

00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:50.791
Kegelapan, Ken.

00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:53.041
Bahaya besar baru lahir,

00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:54.625
aku merasakannya.

00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:58.458
Kau kecewa
tak diundang bertarung,

00:03:58.458 --> 00:04:01.416
tapi kejayaan
tak cuma diraih di arena.

00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:04.291
Tugas lebih mulia menantimu :

00:04:05.041 --> 00:04:07.541
melindungi saudaramu.

00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:09.458
Melindunginya?

00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:11.375
Dia petarung terhebat di dunia.

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:13.041
Dari apa aku melindunginya?

00:04:14.791 --> 00:04:16.291
Dari dirinya sendiri.

00:04:18.541 --> 00:04:21.083
Ryu, bangkitlah.

00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:27.208
<i>Ronde 1, mulai!</i>

00:04:35.791 --> 00:04:39.458
<i>6 tahun berlalu</i>
<i>sejak Turnamen World Warrior awal</i>

00:04:39.541 --> 00:04:43.750
<i>saat pendatang baru bernama Ryu</i>
<i>menjadi legenda.</i>

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:47.541
<i>Namun kisahnya tak lengkap</i>

00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:49.625
<i>tanpa menyebut Ken,</i>

00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:51.541
<i>sahabat masa kecil</i>

00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:53.041
<i>dan rekan latihannya.</i>

00:04:53.083 --> 00:04:53.958
Wawancara
bersama Guru Gouken

00:04:53.958 --> 00:04:55.583
<i>Sejak awal, mereka dianggap</i>

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:57.875
<i>masa depan seni bela diri.</i>

00:04:58.166 --> 00:05:00.666
<i>Masa lalu Ryu sungguh tragis.</i>

00:05:00.708 --> 00:05:04.583
<i>Saat kecil, kematian orang tuanya</i>
<i>menjadikannya yatim piatu.</i>

00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:08.041
<i>Ken telantar</i>
<i>dengan cara lain.</i>

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:09.666
<i>Lahir serba mewah,</i>

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:11.791
<i>Ken rutin membuat onar.</i>

00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:14.791
<i>Usai dikeluarkan</i>
<i>dari banyak asrama</i>

00:05:14.791 --> 00:05:16.291
<i>keluarganya mengirimnya</i>

00:05:16.291 --> 00:05:17.708
<i>ke Jepang.</i>

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.750
<i>Lalu Guru Gouken merawat mereka,</i>

00:05:21.791 --> 00:05:23.500
<i>membesarkan</i>
<i>anak-anak bermasalah itu</i>

00:05:23.541 --> 00:05:25.000
<i>seperti darah dagingnya.</i>

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:26.791
<i>Mereka tak terpisahkan,</i>

00:05:26.791 --> 00:05:28.458
<i>jadi saudara sejati.</i>

00:05:28.458 --> 00:05:30.250
<i>Mereka berlatih keras</i>

00:05:30.291 --> 00:05:32.041
<i>dan bersenang-senang.</i>

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:38.458
Kau cari masalah?

00:05:41.041 --> 00:05:42.541
Boleh ku simpan ini?

00:05:42.541 --> 00:05:43.916
<i>Ah, masa muda!</i>

00:05:44.041 --> 00:05:47.166
<i>Usai Ryu menang</i>
<i>kejuaraan dunia,</i>

00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:48.666
<i>terjadilah tragedi.</i>

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:51.250
<i>Guru Gouken dibunuh,</i>

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:54.541
<i>tragedi yang</i>
<i>menghancurkan hati mereka.</i>

00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:57.541
<i>Mari melompat ke 1993.</i>

00:05:57.541 --> 00:05:59.916
<i>Ryu menghilang tanpa jejak</i>

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:00.875
<i>dan Ken</i>

00:06:00.875 --> 00:06:02.500
<i>menjadi caper ketenaran</i>

00:06:02.541 --> 00:06:04.625
<i>yang tak lagi disegani.</i>

00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:07.625
Aku menyuruhmu
matikan sampah ini!

00:06:09.125 --> 00:06:11.500
- Santai!
- Diam kau, Dan!

00:06:11.541 --> 00:06:13.000
Ayo, tarik napas.

00:06:13.041 --> 00:06:15.291
Napas, duduklah.

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:16.625
Kemari.

00:06:16.791 --> 00:06:19.041
Tolong tenanglah.

00:06:21.291 --> 00:06:23.041
Berhentilah memikirkannya.

00:06:23.166 --> 00:06:24.541
Oke!

00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:26.958
Kau lupa siapa dirimu?

00:06:27.375 --> 00:06:31.333
Kau Ken Masters,
petarung paling hebat.

00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:33.583
Kau penuhi stadion

00:06:33.625 --> 00:06:37.791
dengan ribuan penggemar
yang berebut suvenir

00:06:38.041 --> 00:06:39.916
demi memujamu.

00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:43.625
Taco Bell meneleponku.

00:06:44.541 --> 00:06:45.666
Ya.

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:50.041
Mereka menawarkan menu khusus :
Ken Supreme.

00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:54.125
Kau di puncak kejayaan, kawan.

00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:56.625
Semua orang memujamu.

00:06:58.291 --> 00:06:59.541
Kau yakin?

00:07:00.291 --> 00:07:02.041
Bercanda kau?

00:07:02.208 --> 00:07:05.791
Di luar mereka meneriakkan namamu.
Jelas mereka memujamu.

00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:08.208
Kau memberiku yang mereka mau.

00:07:11.041 --> 00:07:13.291
- Ku beri itu, ya.
- Nah.

00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:16.375
- Kita beri itu!
- Tepat.

00:07:18.125 --> 00:07:20.291
<i>Yo, kalian masuk MTV!</i>

00:07:21.291 --> 00:07:23.583
<i>Ken Masters di A Day in the Life.</i>

00:07:23.791 --> 00:07:25.375
<i>Dua orang ini sangar.</i>

00:07:25.625 --> 00:07:27.666
<i>Aku tak boleh</i>
<i>mencari cuan?</i>

00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:33.125
Dan itu bestie
dan manajerku.

00:07:33.541 --> 00:07:36.500
Siapa taruhan mobil?
Si bodoh. Si tolol.

00:07:37.291 --> 00:07:39.416
Sukses bareng bestie,
itu impian.

00:07:43.291 --> 00:07:46.750
Semua bertanya,
kapan tarung sungguhan?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.291
Aku terus bertarung.

00:07:49.291 --> 00:07:51.666
Tenagaku dari Jolt Cola, kawan!

00:07:52.291 --> 00:07:54.125
Aku akan melawan beruang kutub.

00:07:54.291 --> 00:07:55.416
<i>Aku benci beruang.</i>

00:07:55.458 --> 00:07:57.083
<i>Pilihanku: Duracell!</i>

00:07:57.125 --> 00:07:58.500
<i>Semangat untuk turnamen.</i>

00:08:00.125 --> 00:08:01.250
Pemenang!

00:08:10.458 --> 00:08:11.541
Dasar pecundang!

00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:15.000
Cabut yuk,
pestanya garing.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:17.250
Ngawur, ini seru.

00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:21.208
Masih ada bir!

00:08:38.791 --> 00:08:40.041
Demetrius!

00:08:42.291 --> 00:08:44.041
Nyalakan bom asapnya!

00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:49.291
Kau selalu keren, Ken!

00:08:49.416 --> 00:08:56.916
<i>And I say, yeah, yeah, yeah</i>

00:08:57.041 --> 00:09:02.666
<i>I said hey! What's going on?</i>

00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:08.625
Dan!

00:09:11.958 --> 00:09:13.375
Selamat malam, kawan.

00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:25.375
KOTA METROLAO

00:09:27.291 --> 00:09:30.541
Kenapa tak berfungsi?

00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:39.375
KEKUATAN PSYCHO

00:09:45.791 --> 00:09:48.041
Ini masih kurang.

00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:49.375
Yang Mulia,

00:09:51.291 --> 00:09:53.916
Ini lebih baik dari sebelumnya.

00:09:57.875 --> 00:09:59.458
Tatap aku.

00:09:59.958 --> 00:10:01.708
Aku kurang kuat.

00:10:02.958 --> 00:10:05.791
Fisikku lemah!

00:10:06.708 --> 00:10:10.000
Kita harus capai
daya maksimal

00:10:10.041 --> 00:10:11.541
Kekuatan Psycho.

00:10:11.541 --> 00:10:13.041
Bagaimana bisa jika kau beri aku

00:10:13.041 --> 00:10:16.083
cairan energi ampas ini?

00:10:16.208 --> 00:10:18.125
Yang Mulia, ini diambil

00:10:18.125 --> 00:10:20.333
dari pria-pria paling kekar

00:10:20.375 --> 00:10:21.541
di seluruh Metrolao.

00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:23.541
Sudah ku bilang 100 kali :

00:10:23.541 --> 00:10:25.416
aku mau petarung dengan anugerah

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:27.000
kekuatan mutlak.

00:10:29.958 --> 00:10:31.958
Kekuatan Hadō.

00:10:32.375 --> 00:10:33.833
Aku mencarinya terus,

00:10:33.875 --> 00:10:35.166
aku butuh itu.

00:10:35.791 --> 00:10:37.541
Aku harus menemukannya.

00:10:38.375 --> 00:10:39.666
Ryu.

00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:56.666
Aku benci harus begini.

00:10:59.041 --> 00:11:00.291
Ganti rencana.

00:11:01.791 --> 00:11:03.375
Simpan tongkatmu, Juli.

00:11:03.416 --> 00:11:05.291
Kita pasang jebakan kecil.

00:11:10.041 --> 00:11:11.916
Bangunkan presenter pandir itu.

00:11:27.541 --> 00:11:28.875
Tidak, ampun.

00:11:29.375 --> 00:11:31.000
Kukuku baru saja tumbuh.

00:11:31.041 --> 00:11:32.958
Kau beruntung, Don Sauvage.

00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:35.458
Mulut lemesmu
dimaafkan.

00:11:35.958 --> 00:11:38.041
Benarkah? Terima kasih!

00:11:38.041 --> 00:11:39.500
Dengan 1 syarat.

00:11:40.041 --> 00:11:41.500
Tentu, Mbak Cammy.

00:11:42.291 --> 00:11:43.750
Ku cium sepatumu.

00:11:43.791 --> 00:11:45.250
Ku jilat sekalian.

00:11:50.041 --> 00:11:53.041
Kita gelar turnamen
untuk memancing Ryu keluar.

00:11:53.041 --> 00:11:55.041
Kau akan siaran lagi.

00:11:55.625 --> 00:11:58.166
Ini naskahmu. Bekerjalah.

00:12:01.291 --> 00:12:02.625
Dan jangan.

00:12:03.541 --> 00:12:04.750
coba-coba.

00:12:06.541 --> 00:12:07.750
menipu kami.

00:12:08.791 --> 00:12:09.833
Tak ada tipu-tipu.

00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:11.791
Siap, Nyonya.

00:12:11.791 --> 00:12:13.000
Laksanakan!

00:12:13.041 --> 00:12:13.875
BERITA KOMBAT

00:12:17.208 --> 00:12:18.708
Halo semua,

00:12:18.875 --> 00:12:20.208
aku kembali!

00:12:20.375 --> 00:12:22.541
Selamat datang di Berita Kombat!

00:12:24.875 --> 00:12:27.083
<i>Langsung, berita panas</i>

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:28.125
BERSAMA
DON SAUVAGE

00:12:28.166 --> 00:12:29.791
<i>seputar dunia pertarungan.</i>

00:12:30.583 --> 00:12:31.916
<i>Sedikit ralat,</i>

00:12:32.541 --> 00:12:34.041
<i>maaf atas segalanya.</i>

00:12:34.625 --> 00:12:36.666
<i>Pak Bison pria jantan</i>

00:12:36.708 --> 00:12:40.291
<i>dan seleranya modis,</i>

00:12:40.291 --> 00:12:44.041
<i>tak seperti bualan</i>

00:12:44.041 --> 00:12:45.250
<i>yang ku ucapkan dulu.</i>

00:12:45.291 --> 00:12:48.750
<i>Aku ganti obat,</i>
<i>dan aku minta maaf.</i>

00:12:49.625 --> 00:12:50.791
<i>Berita kilat!</i>

00:12:50.958 --> 00:12:51.541
KABAR TERKINI

00:12:51.583 --> 00:12:53.625
<i>Pak Bison akan menggelar</i>

00:12:53.666 --> 00:12:55.875
<i>Turnamen World Warrior ke-2</i>

00:12:55.875 --> 00:12:57.541
<i>di Kota Metrolao yang indah.</i>

00:12:57.708 --> 00:12:59.166
TURNAMEN WORLD WARRIOR II

00:12:59.208 --> 00:13:01.208
<i>Akankah Ryu sang juara bertahan,</i>

00:13:01.291 --> 00:13:03.541
<i>kembali membela harga dirinya?</i>

00:13:04.541 --> 00:13:08.041
<i>Dan mantan rekan latihannya,</i>
<i>Ken Masters?</i>

00:13:08.041 --> 00:13:10.291
<i>Apa mereka akan bertarung?</i>

00:13:10.291 --> 00:13:12.541
<i>Siapa pemenang duel saudara ini?</i>

00:13:12.708 --> 00:13:14.958
<i>Bison akan menjawabnya,</i>

00:13:15.125 --> 00:13:17.416
<i>beserta misteri lainnya.</i>

00:13:17.958 --> 00:13:20.041
Ken Masters
itu pengecut.

00:13:20.208 --> 00:13:22.041
Ku hajar dia dengan mudah.

00:13:22.291 --> 00:13:24.833
Dia pecundang, mirip ayahnya.

00:13:41.208 --> 00:13:43.625
Jadi ini, Ken Masters si hebat?

00:13:44.041 --> 00:13:45.708
Mengecewakan.

00:13:47.041 --> 00:13:47.958
Ken...

00:13:48.541 --> 00:13:50.166
Kenzo... Kendrick!

00:13:50.541 --> 00:13:52.708
Bahaya.
Ada cewek bening.

00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:54.125
- Hei.
- Hai.

00:13:55.625 --> 00:13:56.958
Tolong.

00:13:57.125 --> 00:13:58.041
Kenapa?

00:13:58.125 --> 00:14:00.500
Tunggu, aku pernah melihatmu.

00:14:00.708 --> 00:14:02.041
Kau ada di pertarunganku.

00:14:02.541 --> 00:14:05.791
<i>Siapa yang terbaik!</i>

00:14:06.708 --> 00:14:07.875
Kau mau apa?

00:14:08.541 --> 00:14:10.166
Namaku Chun-Li.

00:14:15.291 --> 00:14:19.125
Misiku mencari
petarung terhebat di dunia

00:14:20.041 --> 00:14:23.500
Untuk ikut
Turnamen World Warrior ke-2.

00:14:26.041 --> 00:14:28.375
Diundang ke sana ialah kehormatan

00:14:28.458 --> 00:14:31.458
bagi praktisi bela diri sejati.

00:14:36.875 --> 00:14:38.458
Tuan M. Bison,

00:14:38.541 --> 00:14:42.875
menggelar acara besar ini
di koloseum kekaisarannya.

00:14:45.125 --> 00:14:46.541
Kesatria tangguh,

00:14:47.041 --> 00:14:48.333
jagoan sakti,

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:49.833
petarung buas,

00:14:50.208 --> 00:14:53.708
dan jagoan mengerikan
semua bersiap.

00:14:54.125 --> 00:14:55.625
<i>Kau menang!</i>

00:14:57.708 --> 00:14:59.166
8 Kesatria.

00:14:59.541 --> 00:15:00.750
tanpa aturan

00:15:01.291 --> 00:15:02.916
Yang terpenting,

00:15:03.875 --> 00:15:05.541
hanya ada 1 yang tersisa:

00:15:05.791 --> 00:15:07.500
sang juara dunia.

00:15:11.541 --> 00:15:14.041
Ken, kau siap bertarung?

00:15:20.208 --> 00:15:22.500
Kabarnya
acara receh ini kembali.

00:15:22.666 --> 00:15:24.458
Aku bukan bocah lagi.

00:15:24.875 --> 00:15:26.791
Aku main di liga besar.

00:15:26.958 --> 00:15:29.250
Kau jadi badut tontonan.

00:15:30.291 --> 00:15:31.583
Badut tontonan?

00:15:31.625 --> 00:15:33.250
Kau bahan lelucon di sini.

00:15:34.458 --> 00:15:36.625
Dulu kau punya harga diri.

00:15:36.875 --> 00:15:38.250
Ada apa denganmu?

00:15:39.875 --> 00:15:40.875
<i>Lakukan.</i>

00:15:41.791 --> 00:15:42.791
<i>Lakukan.</i>

00:15:43.291 --> 00:15:44.791
<i>Tunggu apa lagi?</i>

00:15:44.958 --> 00:15:45.958
<i>Ryu.</i>

00:15:48.708 --> 00:15:50.041
Ryu akan hadir.

00:15:50.958 --> 00:15:53.916
Kau orang terakhir yang
melihatnya sebelum dia hilang.

00:15:54.125 --> 00:15:55.291
Beri tahu aku.

00:16:14.041 --> 00:16:16.250
Tiap mangkuk membawa pelajaran.

00:16:16.791 --> 00:16:17.791
baru.

00:16:18.875 --> 00:16:20.291
Ini luar biasa.

00:16:20.958 --> 00:16:22.375
Hai. Dozo.

00:16:23.208 --> 00:16:24.666
Terima kasih.

00:16:25.458 --> 00:16:26.625
Nyam-nyam.

00:16:27.666 --> 00:16:29.291
Baunya unik.

00:16:30.541 --> 00:16:32.500
Menyengat hidung.

00:16:33.291 --> 00:16:35.125
Sup merpati busuk.

00:16:35.375 --> 00:16:36.916
Resep guruku.

00:16:38.208 --> 00:16:39.666
Kalian mau duduk?

00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.541
- Kami pamit.
- Aku sudah kenyang.

00:16:43.041 --> 00:16:45.291
Tapi ini lezat.
Konnichiwa.

00:16:45.541 --> 00:16:46.750
Jangan bicara begitu, sayang.

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:51.083
JALAN CLEVELAND

00:16:59.791 --> 00:17:01.000
Halo, Momo.

00:17:01.041 --> 00:17:02.458
Kau lapar?

00:17:06.291 --> 00:17:07.500
Ini,

00:17:08.041 --> 00:17:09.208
Untukmu,

00:17:24.541 --> 00:17:27.291
Aku tahu aku mengecewakanmu,

00:17:27.541 --> 00:17:30.208
tapi ku bisa membuatmu bangga
Guru Gouken.

00:17:35.208 --> 00:17:37.250
Akan ku buat kau bangga.

00:17:40.625 --> 00:17:42.083
Aku akan menang.

00:17:49.625 --> 00:17:51.375
Dan kau takkan

00:17:51.708 --> 00:17:53.125
