00:20:16.041 --> 00:20:18.625
Alasan paling konyol.

00:20:20.041 --> 00:20:21.791
Kenapa tak menangkis pukulanku?

00:20:24.125 --> 00:20:25.375
Sudah kubilang,

00:20:26.791 --> 00:20:28.375
aku berhenti bertarung.

00:20:28.958 --> 00:20:30.708
Aku sudah berjanji.

00:20:31.291 --> 00:20:32.458
Ryu.

00:20:32.541 --> 00:20:35.416
ini bukan takdirmu.

00:20:36.125 --> 00:20:37.833
Kau menolak jadi dirimu sendiri.

00:20:39.708 --> 00:20:41.875
Berapa kali harus kubilang?

00:20:42.291 --> 00:20:44.125
Aku bukan pria yang dulu.

00:20:49.458 --> 00:20:51.750
Entah apa kata gurumu,

00:20:52.041 --> 00:20:53.625
