itu membuang waktu.

00:21:05.041 --> 00:21:06.333
<i>Ryu.</i>

00:21:07.291 --> 00:21:09.208
<i>jangan menyerah pada kegelapan.</i>

00:21:14.041 --> 00:21:16.750
Aku berbeda dari
6 tahun lalu.

00:21:18.541 --> 00:21:21.041
Mungkin giliran Ken
jadi juara.

00:21:22.458 --> 00:21:24.791
Dia menerima undangan Bison.

00:21:26.208 --> 00:21:28.291
Dia menuju Kota Metrolao.

00:21:42.541 --> 00:21:46.375
<i>Kau tak bisa sembunyi, Ryu.</i>

00:21:46.625 --> 00:21:48.291
<i>Kau haus kuasa,</i>

00:21:48.708 --> 00:21:50.666
<i>sama sepertiku.</i>

00:21:51.541 --> 00:21:52.750
<i>Hadapi aku.</i>

00:21:52.791 --> 00:21:55.041
<i>atau kuhancurkan</i>

00:21:55.291 --> 00:21:57.875
<i>pemenang turnamen itu.</i>

00:21:58.291 --> 00:21:59.375
<i>Akuma,</i>

00:22:17.041 --> 00:22:20.041
TURNAMEN WORLD WARRIOR II

00:22:29.791 --> 00:22:33.291
Yakin kita harus
membawa Guru Gouken?

00:22:33.291 --> 00:22:37.000
Kita di sini demi dia.
Lindungi dia sepenuh nyawa.

00:22:49.291 --> 00:22:50.583
Wah, wah...

00:22:53.208 --> 00:22:54.791
Sedang apa kau di sini?

00:22:54.875 --> 00:22:57.291
Ada mobil ikut turnamen?

00:22:57.291 --> 00:22:58.791
Guile.

00:22:58.833 --> 00:23:00.541
