00:23:33.291 --> 00:23:36.083
Darahku 1/18 Jepang, kampungan.

00:23:36.291 --> 00:23:38.166
Kapan parasit ini kau usir?

00:23:38.375 --> 00:23:40.000
Dia menguras energimu.

00:23:40.041 --> 00:23:41.708
Tak ada yang menguras!

00:23:41.791 --> 00:23:44.791
Kami mitra,
tak saling menghisap.

00:23:44.791 --> 00:23:47.208
Guile, jangan hajar yang lemah.

00:23:47.375 --> 00:23:49.291
Fokuslah pada turnamen.

00:23:49.458 --> 00:23:51.666
Kau takkan sulit fokus,

00:23:51.708 --> 00:23:53.041
Ryu takkan hadir.

00:23:59.541 --> 00:24:01.875
Kau beruntung
ada oksigen memisahkan.

00:24:15.541 --> 00:24:16.791
Itu aneh.

00:24:17.208 --> 00:24:19.375
Kelakuannya aneh sekali.

00:24:20.208 --> 00:24:21.666
Ayo, kemari.

00:24:22.291 --> 00:24:25.750
Jangan biarkan dia menghasutmu,
dia itu gila.

00:24:25.791 --> 00:24:27.333
Jelas dia merasa minder.

00:24:33.125 --> 00:24:34.791
Siapa yang bisa mengalahkanmu?

00:24:42.541 --> 00:24:43.791
Keren.

00:24:47.541 --> 00:24:49.625
Permisi.

00:25:10.041 --> 00:25:12.125
Salah kamar, bajingan.

00:25:24.541 --> 00:25:26.291
Senang bertemu denganmu, kawan.

00:25:26.791 --> 00:25:28.000
"Kawan"?

00:25:32.375 --> 00:25:33.458
<i>Akuma,</i>

00:25:33.541 --> 00:25:34.583
<i>tidak!</i>

00:25:57.291 --> 00:25:58.375
Guru!

00:25:58.625 --> 00:25:59.708
Jangan mendekat.

00:26:05.208 --> 00:26:07.666
Aku tak mencarimu, Gouken.

00:26:08.375 --> 00:26:10.708
Aku mencari sang juara.

00:26:11.208 --> 00:26:12.708
Ryu.

00:26:13.291 --> 00:26:15.708
jika kau mau menyelamatkannya,

00:26:15.708 --> 00:26:18.375
hadapi aku!

00:26:22.500 --> 00:26:23.708
Ryu.

00:26:24.708 --> 00:26:26.916
jangan menyerah pada kegelapan.

00:26:28.625 --> 00:26:30.416
Saudaraku, Gouken,

00:26:30.875 --> 00:26:33.333
menahan langkahmu.

00:26:41.791 --> 00:26:44.166
Ryu, tunggu apa lagi?

00:26:44.958 --> 00:26:46.000
Lakukan!

00:26:46.791 --> 00:26:47.916
Lakukan!

00:26:52.625 --> 00:26:54.875
Masih begitu muda.

00:26:55.625 --> 00:26:59.333
Kebencian di hatimu
belum cukup kuat.

00:26:59.791 --> 00:27:02.125
Biar ini membangkitkannya!

00:27:03.541 --> 00:27:04.541
Tidak, jangan!

00:27:08.791 --> 00:27:10.583
Maafkan aku, Guru!

00:27:20.208 --> 00:27:22.625
Ryu, kau bisa mencegahnya.

00:27:36.291 --> 00:27:37.416
Selalu gegabah.

00:27:37.458 --> 00:27:39.541
Kau mau apa?
Ken, dengarkan aku.

00:27:39.541 --> 00:27:41.875
Kau tak boleh ikut turnamen ini.

00:27:42.291 --> 00:27:43.875
Apalagi memenangkannya.

00:27:44.541 --> 00:27:46.375
6 tahun kau menghilang,

00:27:46.625 --> 00:27:48.625
