00:27:49.041 --> 00:27:50.208
- Hentikan.
- Diam kau!

00:27:54.541 --> 00:27:55.625
Ken...

00:27:56.541 --> 00:27:57.708
hentikan!

00:28:06.125 --> 00:28:07.500
Kau tak tahan.

00:28:07.791 --> 00:28:09.291
Tak tahan apa?

00:28:22.791 --> 00:28:23.791
Duduk.

00:28:27.125 --> 00:28:29.458
Kau iri
melihatku naik ring,

00:28:29.541 --> 00:28:30.666
dan membuktikan pada dunia

00:28:30.708 --> 00:28:32.500
bahwa aku lebih hebat darimu.

00:28:32.541 --> 00:28:35.250
Bertarung akan bahayakan nyawamu.

00:28:36.541 --> 00:28:37.583
Sombongnya.

00:28:54.125 --> 00:28:56.166
Tidak, jangan lakukan ini.

00:28:56.833 --> 00:28:59.208
Jangan lakukan ini!

00:29:00.125 --> 00:29:01.416
Dengarkan aku.

00:29:01.458 --> 00:29:02.916
Sialan!

00:29:05.541 --> 00:29:07.083
sadarlah,

00:29:07.791 --> 00:29:11.500
kau tak sadar
bahaya yang menantimu.

00:29:11.541 --> 00:29:16.291
Yang ku tahu, aku
akan menangkan turnamen ini.

00:29:16.291 --> 00:29:17.500
Kali ini,

00:29:17.541 --> 00:29:19.041
kau akan kalah.

00:29:20.041 --> 00:29:21.208
Sekali ini,

00:29:21.875 --> 00:29:23.250
dengarkan aku.

00:29:23.375 --> 00:29:26.750
Akan ku buktikan nilaiku,
dan kau tak bisa menahanku!

00:29:27.875 --> 00:29:28.875
Tak bisa!

00:29:28.916 --> 00:29:30.083
Kenneth?

00:29:30.125 --> 00:29:32.791
Hentikan film birumu,
kunciku rusak.

00:29:33.291 --> 00:29:34.416
Baiklah.

00:29:35.375 --> 00:29:36.416
Baiklah.

00:29:36.708 --> 00:29:38.375
- Bagus.
- Ken.

00:29:38.375 --> 00:29:40.250
Dan, seriuslah!

00:29:40.291 --> 00:29:41.708
Hai, Dan.

00:29:41.958 --> 00:29:43.250
Ry-Ry?

00:29:43.625 --> 00:29:46.416
- Kau tak beri pilihan.
- Kau mau apa?

00:29:46.625 --> 00:29:47.958
Terlambat.

00:29:48.541 --> 00:29:49.750
Daftar peserta sudah ditutup.

00:29:50.958 --> 00:29:52.541
Dan kau tak termasuk.

00:29:52.625 --> 00:29:55.791
Dan, ambil barangku
dan Guru Gouken.

00:29:56.208 --> 00:29:57.250
Kita pindah hotel.

00:29:57.708 --> 00:30:00.250
Kenapa bukan dia yang pindah.

00:30:01.458 --> 00:30:02.916
Senang bertemu denganmu, Ry.

00:30:02.958 --> 00:30:04.250
Aku juga, Dan.

00:30:05.041 --> 00:30:07.041
Indah bukan?
Reuni ini!

00:30:33.541 --> 00:30:35.625
Bangsat kau!

00:30:39.125 --> 00:30:40.416
<i>Markas Interpol di sini,</i>

00:30:40.458 --> 00:30:42.625
<i>Agen Chun-Li, masuk.</i>

00:30:43.625 --> 00:30:46.541
<i>Ku ulangi,</i>
<i>Markas Interpol memanggil Agen Li.</i>

00:30:46.541 --> 00:30:48.208
TUAN BISON MENGGELAR
...

