00:31:28.166 --> 00:31:31.000
Dia butuh bukti nyata.

00:31:31.041 --> 00:31:33.083
Itu katanya, bukan kataku.

00:31:33.125 --> 00:31:35.125
Aku percaya padamu.

00:31:36.708 --> 00:31:38.958
Aku selalu percaya padamu, Chun.

00:31:39.875 --> 00:31:42.208
Aku harus melumpuhkan dia sendiri.

00:31:42.250 --> 00:31:43.000
SENJATA RAHASIA BISON

00:31:44.041 --> 00:31:46.125
Tolong, jangan bertindak

00:31:46.458 --> 00:31:47.666
gegabah.

00:31:48.291 --> 00:31:49.750
Kau mabuk ya?

00:31:49.791 --> 00:31:50.916
Jika ya, janji

00:31:50.958 --> 00:31:52.750
