00:32:01.458 --> 00:32:03.041
Bantuan tiba.

00:33:23.208 --> 00:33:24.916
Kurasa aku melihat...

00:33:25.791 --> 00:33:27.791
hantu.

00:33:28.916 --> 00:33:30.666
Selamat malam, Ozeki.

00:33:32.041 --> 00:33:33.916
Aneh.

00:33:34.041 --> 00:33:37.875
Cuma temanku yang memanggil Ozeki.

00:33:42.708 --> 00:33:44.916
Aku minta tolong.

00:33:49.791 --> 00:33:51.666
Aku mau kau serahkan

00:33:52.458 --> 00:33:54.208
posisimu di turnamen.

00:33:59.958 --> 00:34:02.375
Aku pria dermawan,

00:34:05.041 --> 00:34:07.208
tapi tidak bodoh.

00:34:07.625 --> 00:34:10.958
Akuma akan serang
siapa pun yang jadi juara.

00:34:11.041 --> 00:34:14.041
Saat Akuma meninggalkan alam roh,

00:34:15.541 --> 00:34:18.083
