00:34:18.708 --> 00:34:21.750
Sepertinya kau
tak siap melawannya.

00:34:22.791 --> 00:34:24.666
Aku akan siap.

00:34:25.041 --> 00:34:27.208
Kalau begitu...

00:34:29.208 --> 00:34:31.541
