00:34:32.041 --> 00:34:33.958
Jika kau menang,

00:34:34.041 --> 00:34:36.416
ku serahkan posisiku.

00:36:11.541 --> 00:36:13.583
<i>Kau menahan diri.</i>

00:36:15.125 --> 00:36:16.541
<i>Harus.</i>

00:36:17.791 --> 00:36:20.625
<i>Aku melawan gejolak dalam diriku.</i>

00:36:21.291 --> 00:36:23.666
Jangan takluk pada kekuatan itu!

00:36:41.208 --> 00:36:42.833
Pertarungan hebat.

00:36:43.791 --> 00:36:45.000
Kini pergilah,

00:36:46.041 --> 00:36:48.708
ambil posisiku...

00:36:50.541 --> 00:36:52.041
dan...

00:36:53.208 --> 00:36:54.708
