00:36:56.791 --> 00:36:58.166
Aku akan menang.

00:36:59.958 --> 00:37:01.416
Hei, tolol!

00:37:01.458 --> 00:37:02.916
Jangan diam saja,

00:37:02.958 --> 00:37:04.458
bantu aku berdiri!

00:37:15.875 --> 00:37:17.666
Hentikan keributan ini!

00:37:18.541 --> 00:37:20.958
Bikin telingaku berdarah.

00:37:21.708 --> 00:37:24.291
Lihatlah pecundang ini.

00:37:24.875 --> 00:37:28.125
Cepat gerak ke panggung.

00:37:28.166 --> 00:37:30.000
Siap, Mbak.

00:37:33.875 --> 00:37:36.833
<i>Berita Kombat, bersama Don Sauvage!</i>

00:37:37.166 --> 00:37:38.625
<i>Apa kabar!</i>

00:37:39.916 --> 00:37:41.791
<i>Berita gempar!</i>

00:37:42.125 --> 00:37:46.416
<i>Saat Street Fighter terbaik</i>
<i>bersiap untuk turnamen,</i>

00:37:46.458 --> 00:37:50.333
<i>ku dengar kita akan saksikan</i>
<i>duel impian kita.</i>

00:37:50.375 --> 00:37:54.000
<i>Ryu melawan Ken Masters!</i>

00:38:07.041 --> 00:38:09.416
Barang ini tak diberikan
sembarangan.

00:38:09.541 --> 00:38:11.958
Bestie-ku, Charlie, sungguh...

00:38:12.708 --> 00:38:14.541
Traktir semua!

00:38:15.833 --> 00:38:17.083
Zangief mau.

00:38:17.958 --> 00:38:19.416
Di mana dia?

00:38:20.041 --> 00:38:21.791
Siapa namamu tadi? Doug?

