Dengan apa?
Memukuli mobil?

00:38:33.708 --> 00:38:35.916
Dan memukuli hewan buas!

00:38:35.958 --> 00:38:37.000
Panda!

00:38:39.875 --> 00:38:42.041
Nah, mulai panas nih.

00:38:43.791 --> 00:38:45.666
... 7, 8 otot perut!

00:38:46.791 --> 00:38:47.791
Gila!

00:38:47.791 --> 00:38:48.791
Ken...

00:38:49.041 --> 00:38:50.375
Lupakan, Dan.

00:38:51.541 --> 00:38:53.500
Dia tak tahu? Bagus.

00:38:53.541 --> 00:38:54.541
Diamlah, Guile!

00:38:54.541 --> 00:38:56.500
Kita adu panco, Dan?

00:38:57.708 --> 00:38:59.208
Gini kawan,

00:38:59.208 --> 00:39:00.666
